  "$comment": [
    "Station-pair fare overrides. An override always wins over the slab calculation, because a",
    "published exact fare is better evidence than a distance bucket.",
    "",
    "This is the OFFICIAL MMRDA Mumbai Monorail single-journey-ticket matrix, transcribed from",
    "https://mmrda.maharashtra.gov.in/en/division/mono-piu/fare-structure on 2026-08-06. Fares are",
    "symmetric by nature, but the published table contradicts itself on 19 pairs; where it does, the",
    "HIGHER fare is used, so an error can only ever over-quote by ₹10 and never under-quote.",
    "",
    "The station-code order in this table (GMC..CHR) is the exact reverse of our curated monorail",
    "station order, which independently confirms that sequence against the operator.",
    "",
    "IMPORTANT: the Monorail is currently SUSPENDED, so these fares are not shown to users. They are",
    "captured now so the data is ready when service resumes."
